id: pm-web-184g
title: Pin pm-web container dependencies and minimize build context
description: Remove mutable production image/package resolution and prevent local/runtime artifacts from entering the Docker build context.
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: docker,privacy,security,supply-chain
created_at: "2026-07-11T14:28:29.432Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-12T14:37:58.396Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-11T14:28:34.037Z"
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: "Node base image uses an immutable digest; embedded pm CLI is an explicit version; Docker context excludes git, pm tracker, env, node_modules, tests, docs, logs, and nested dependency trees; image builds and all tests pass."
risk: high
confidence: high
resolution: "Pinned the Node base by digest and pm CLI 2026.7.11, and excluded nested dependencies plus local/private artifacts from Docker context."
expected_result: Production builds are reproducible and cannot accidentally send private local artifacts in their build context.
actual_result: "67 tests, typecheck, production audit, diff check, and production image build pass; live pm-web reports pm CLI 2026.7.11."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-12T14:37:58.396Z",codex,"Verification correction 2026-07-12: Docker now uses the pinned multi-architecture Node image digest sha256:752ea8a2f758c34002a0461bd9f1cee4f9a3c36d48494586f60ffce1fc708e0e and the runtime dependency @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.7.12 from package-lock; the review image built successfully and reports pm 2026.7.12."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
  .dockerignore,project,Sensitive and unnecessary build-context exclusions
  Dockerfile,project,Immutable Node digest and exact pm CLI version
tests[4]{command,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  npm audit --omit=dev,project,120
  npm run typecheck,project,300
  npm test,project,300
  production Docker image build,project,600
close_reason: Container dependency and build-context hardening completed with full tests and a successful production build.
